From: richie-rich90454 <rjian880@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 0007/0014] Remove remote extensions

Removes the tunnel-forwarding extension and drops it from the extension build
lists, and renames tunnelApplicationName to jahaziel-tunnel so the binary and
process names match the product.

Rebased onto upstream 1.137.0. Same effect as the previous capture: the extension
tree is deleted, the two build-list references are removed, and product.json is
renamed. The old capture no longer applied because upstream moved the build files.

Verification: ide/tests/patch-smoke.sh (0007-*, 0009-*)

---
